  "title": "A delegation of the UN-affiliated Regional Centre for Space Science and Technology Education, led by Director General Dr. Eng. Awni Mohammad Khasawneh, visits the Institute of Laser Research and Applications at Beni-Suef University, Egypt",
  "excerpt": "A Regional Centre delegation led by Dr. Awni Khasawneh visited the Institute of Laser Research and Applications at Beni-Suef University to activate their memorandum of understanding and explore cooperation.",
  "body": "<figure><img src=\"@media/p/dc3839b89dc7ddfd.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"450\"></figure>\n<p>The Institute of Laser Research and Applications at Beni-Suef University, Egypt, received Dr. Awni Mohammad Khasawneh, Director General of the UN-affiliated Regional Centre for Space Science and Technology Education for Western Asia, based in Jordan; Dr. Ammar Sakaji, Deputy Director for Academic Affairs; and Mr. Khaled Nasser Hussein, Deputy Director for Administrative Affairs, in the presence of Dr. Osama Shalabiea, Dean of the Faculty of Navigation Science and Space Technology.</p>\n<p>The visit is part of activating the memorandum of understanding signed between the university and the Regional Centre on joint educational and research projects that help build a new generation of young scientists, researchers and students, and of exploring cooperation between the institute and the centre.</p>\n<p>The institute's dean, Dr. Tarek Ali, and its researchers reviewed the importance of lasers and their various applications, and then toured with the delegation the multi-wavelength femtosecond laser laboratories and the high-power nanosecond laser laboratories, as well as the laboratories for laser applications in biology and microbiology and the training laboratory for light and low-power lasers.</p>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"@media/p/4a61b673ea180c0c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"450\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"@media/p/1524cd41bdd71d89.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"450\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"@media/p/468be8c0a31cd50d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"@media/p/858efaa391c3a536.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"450\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"@media/p/603b6c7096a2f754.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"@media/p/9ac309181d669784.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"450\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n<img src=\"@media/p/4bc479ab5a